398
00:22:44,224 --> 00:22:47,964
The terminal value of this path is not two point five percent growth.

399
00:22:48,404 --> 00:22:52,724
It is whatever number you get when you multiply any positive number by zero

400
00:22:52,724 --> 00:22:53,644
surviving humans.

401
00:22:54,504 --> 00:22:55,744
The math is elegant.

402
00:22:56,104 --> 00:22:57,554
The humans are not.

403
00:22:58,024 --> 00:22:59,194
What We Did Instead.

404
00:23:00,564 --> 00:23:01,944
Here's what happened on my planet.

405
00:23:02,524 --> 00:23:06,284
We looked at the trend line, noticed where it went, and decided to point

406
00:23:06,284 --> 00:23:07,044
it somewhere else.

407
00:23:07,644 --> 00:23:11,784
We signed the treaty, redirected the weapons budget, and then realized the

408
00:23:11,784 --> 00:23:14,384
