00:23:26,664 --> 00:23:30,424
This manual calls the complete version of that approach the Earth Optimization

413
00:23:30,424 --> 00:23:30,924
Protocol.

414
00:23:31,884 --> 00:23:33,024
This took us about six years.

415
00:23:33,724 --> 00:23:37,424
It would have taken three arguing about it, because we are also a species

416
00:23:37,424 --> 00:23:41,084
