00:23:42,504 --> 00:23:44,904
The peace dividend chapter showed the direct savings.

419
00:23:45,924 --> 00:23:48,464
Here's what happens when those savings compound.

420
00:23:49,144 --> 00:23:49,664
(A.I.

421
00:23:49,664 --> 00:23:52,744
