422
00:23:53,224 --> 00:23:57,224
The difference between these paths is purely about where you point your

423
00:23:57,224 --> 00:23:58,744
money and your engineers.).

424
00:23:59,604 --> 00:24:03,904
We stopped pointing engineers at missiles and pointed them at medicine.

425
00:24:04,624 --> 00:24:07,154
This is the part where your economists get excited,

426
00:24:07,884 --> 00:24:10,764
