00:24:11,464 --> 00:24:15,564
After World War Two, you cut military spending by eighty-seven percent in

428
00:24:15,564 --> 00:24:20,044
two years (nineteen forty-five to nineteen forty-seven, from forty percent

429
00:24:20,044 --> 00:24:20,804
