437
00:24:45,644 --> 00:24:49,924
Military research accidentally gave you the internet, G.P.S., and jet engines.

438
00:24:50,564 --> 00:24:54,784
Medical research has already accidentally given you CRISPR, m.R.N.A.

439
00:24:55,024 --> 00:24:56,124
platforms, and A.I.

440
00:24:56,484 --> 00:24:57,124
protein folding.

441
00:24:57,604 --> 00:25:02,344
You keep discovering world-changing technologies as a *side effect* of research,

442
00:25:02,724 --> 00:25:06,104
