456
00:25:42,884 --> 00:25:47,344
being spent on the *consequences* of not curing diseases instead of on *curing

457
00:25:47,344 --> 00:25:48,024
diseases*.

458
00:25:48,644 --> 00:25:52,864
You currently produce first treatments for about fifteen diseases per year,

459
00:25:53,104 --> 00:25:56,144
which at that rate means you'll cure all six thousand six hundred and fifty

460
00:25:56,144 --> 00:25:59,634
diseases you have no treatment for in approximately never.

461
00:26:00,544 --> 00:26:06,364
Your decentralized F.D.A., scaled to the physical ceiling of how many humans

462
00:26:06,364 --> 00:26:09,964
