464
00:26:14,584 --> 00:26:19,504
As diseases get cured, all that lost productivity comes back as growth.

465
00:26:20,064 --> 00:26:22,424
We watched it happen in real time.

466
00:26:23,124 --> 00:26:27,044
It was like watching someone take their foot off the brake and being surprised

467
00:26:27,044 --> 00:26:28,404
the car went faster.

468
00:26:28,884 --> 00:26:31,164
Our governments stopped losing money to stupidity.

469
00:26:32,324 --> 00:26:37,364
Your Political Dysfunction Tax documents one hundred and one trillion dollars

470
00:26:37,364 --> 00:26:42,524
per year in money your governments waste on corruption, redundancy, regulations

471
00:26:42,524 --> 00:26:47,124
