473
00:26:48,524 --> 00:26:50,384
That last part bears repeating:

474
00:26:50,464 --> 00:26:53,434
you have nine agencies doing the same thing.

475
00:26:53,664 --> 00:26:56,104
Not nine agencies doing nine things.

476
00:26:56,684 --> 00:27:01,824
Nine agencies doing *one* thing, and the one thing is paperwork about the

477
00:27:01,824 --> 00:27:02,864
