478
00:27:04,124 --> 00:27:05,264
We used E.O.S.

479
00:27:05,264 --> 00:27:08,884
ownership to buy into the companies whose lobbying already controlled the

480
00:27:08,884 --> 00:27:09,784
policy bottlenecks,

481
00:27:10,444 --> 00:27:14,104
then pointed that machinery at shareholder-positive reforms.

482
00:27:14,474 --> 00:27:18,424
I.A.B.s were the detachable tool for campaigns that needed a self-financing

483
00:27:18,444 --> 00:27:19,124
