484
00:27:20,184 --> 00:27:24,404
Your species had never tried paying the existing machine to stop damaging

485
00:27:24,404 --> 00:27:25,644
its own shareholders.

486
00:27:26,444 --> 00:27:28,044
Your economists call this "radical."

487
00:27:28,384 --> 00:27:30,044
Your dictionary calls it "obvious."

488
00:27:30,744 --> 00:27:34,184
The recovered money went to whatever produced the most value:

489
00:27:34,584 --> 00:27:39,144
migration reform, lead elimination, science funding, regulatory modernization.

490
00:27:39,804 --> 00:27:41,964
These three things compound on each other.

491
00:27:42,244 --> 00:27:46,324
Better-funded research produces innovations, which cure diseases, which

492
00:27:46,324 --> 00:27:50,004
make people healthier and more productive, which grows the economy, which

493
00:27:50,004 --> 00:27:52,424
