494
00:27:52,804 --> 00:27:54,144
It's a virtuous cycle.

495
00:27:54,924 --> 00:27:58,924
You're currently running the vicious version, where sick people can't work,

496
00:27:59,004 --> 00:28:02,604
so the economy shrinks, so there's less money for research, so people stay

497
00:28:02,604 --> 00:28:03,104
